WEBVTT

00:00:00.670 --> 00:00:02.820
<i>Last time on </i>Zombie Land Saga Revenge<i>,</i>

00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:05.510
<i>we somehow managed to get back 
into doing the idol thing!</i>

00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:07.350
<i>Our first TV appearance 
in a while was co-hosting</i>

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:10.920
<i>a segment with Saga's own 
rock star, White Ryu-san!</i>

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:12.720
<i>Saki-chan has looked up 
to him for a long time,</i>

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:14.380
<i>so she was really touched 
and really out of control!</i>

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:15.960
<i>Could it be... love? Oh, my!</i>

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:18.640
<i>But then, after Saki-chan learned 
Ryu-san's radio show was going to end,</i>

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.410
<i>she went on a real tear!</i>

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:22.280
<i>Saki-chan opened up about 
her passionate feelings,</i>

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:24.170
<i>and Ryu-san entrusted her with his!</i>

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:27.660
<i>Now, Franchouchou is going 
to be hosting his radio show,</i>

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:31.010
<i></i>So Saga Can Be Saga<i>!
 Now, Saga, burn bright!</i>

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:43.230
<b>Iron Frill</b>

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:51.150
<b>Iron Frill</b>

00:00:51.710 --> 00:00:53.750
<i>Synchronized moves at this level...</i>

00:00:54.140 --> 00:00:56.500
<i>are probably still beyond us.</i>

00:00:57.560 --> 00:01:00.610
<i>What happiness means</i>

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:11.020
Ai-chan!

00:01:11.020 --> 00:01:14.270
Kotaro-san's about to get out of the bath...

00:01:14.630 --> 00:01:15.250
Ai-san?

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:18.230
I-It's nothing! I was almost done.

00:01:18.950 --> 00:01:20.930
What were you looking up?

00:01:23.730 --> 00:01:24.890
All kinds of stuff.

00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:28.900
Don't eat that! It's not for eating!

00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:30.540
Hold it right there, Tae!

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:35.300
Even if we have nothing else, 
we still have the future.

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:38.190
A lowest point? Starting over from zero? 
That's just part of the saga.

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:41.020
Even if we burn out in the process, 
we'll make it come true!

00:01:41.020 --> 00:01:43.240
This is where our revenge begins!

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:48.370
<b>{title}Zombie Land Saga 
Revenge</b>

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:53.670
<b>The Acoustic SAGA of Love and Youth</b>

00:03:02.550 --> 00:03:04.450
<i>A performance at Plaza 656!</i>

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:06.420
<i>A regular radio show!</i>

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:08.370
Please come and see us!

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:09.000
<b>Franchouchou 

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:10.290
Thank you so much!

00:03:11.340 --> 00:03:14.330
It feels like we're starting to make 
some real progress with our work!

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:15.960
<b>Mini-Live 
Performance
 Kachion Mall</b>

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:19.380
Looks like the schedule is 
finally starting to fill out.

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:22.020
Even though half the things
 on there are still just odd jobs...

00:03:22.020 --> 00:03:24.580
Hell, if we're paying back our 
debt and doing idol stuff,

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:26.630
that's gotta be smooth sailing! Right?

00:03:26.630 --> 00:03:28.710
Not even close, actually.

00:03:31.970 --> 00:03:34.020
If we start getting complacent now,

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:37.580
we're always going to be known as 
the local idols who bombed at EFS.

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:50.300
We've got to go beyond that.

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:53.080
Rise above what people expect from us... 
and what's happened to us in the past.

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:57.050
If we can't, we'll basically 
just be dead and rotting.

00:03:58.890 --> 00:04:02.900
The entertainment industry has always 
been a cutthroat competition.

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:05.690
To regress has often been 
equivalent to dying.

00:04:16.370 --> 00:04:18.070
Sounds like a challenge to me!

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:19.890
Right. One we'll simply have to rise to.

00:04:19.890 --> 00:04:21.700
I'm not gonna lose!

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:24.560
You too, Tae-chan!

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:28.030
<b>Franchouchou 
Mini-Concert & Meet and Greet</b>

00:04:26.020 --> 00:04:28.040
<i>Ai-chan is right.</i>

00:04:28.220 --> 00:04:31.040
<i>We have to keep moving forward.</i>

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:32.960
<b>Franchouchou Meet & Greet</b>

00:04:31.310 --> 00:04:32.960
Thanks for always supporting us!

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:35.420
Number Three is so cool...

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:37.880
<b>Number 3
 Line Ends Here</b>

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:37.890
I know, right?! She's just really sharp!

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:41.100
Ai-san! Which do you think is better?

00:04:41.100 --> 00:04:43.370
Fully extending to the 
right or stopping here?

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:48.050
Hey, Ai! About the intro for tomorrow's show, 
what do you think about this?

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:51.970
Hey, hey, which do you 
think makes me look cuter?

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:53.120
Let's see...

00:04:55.700 --> 00:04:57.950
I don't think it matters, honestly.

00:05:03.520 --> 00:05:04.980
Ai-chan, what should I do about this?!

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:06.690
Ai! I gotta ask you something!

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:08.360
Ai-san, please!

00:05:08.360 --> 00:05:09.480
Ai-chan!

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:13.400
Sakura, you're out in front.

00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:15.720
Junko and Lily, you'll want 
to be on the back right.

00:05:15.720 --> 00:05:17.910
Saki and Yugiri on the back left.

00:05:18.360 --> 00:05:19.990
A little further back.

00:05:24.440 --> 00:05:27.460
Iron Frill is coming to our town!

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:30.060
Iron Frill is coming to our town...

00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:33.020
This show's gonna be a big one now!

00:05:34.070 --> 00:05:38.090
It's a raid! A raid! A raid! A raiiid!

00:05:38.090 --> 00:05:39.240
Raid this, you—

00:05:45.390 --> 00:05:48.540
Wrong! You will respond, "Sir, yes, sir!"

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:50.380
S-Sir, yes, si—

00:05:50.980 --> 00:05:54.450
You're a bunch of zombies 
writhing around in the muck!

00:05:55.380 --> 00:05:58.130
Hell, no, you're lower than 
zombies! You're maggots!

00:05:58.130 --> 00:05:59.570
Could you give it a rest?

00:05:59.570 --> 00:06:01.000
What's this about Iron Frill?

00:06:02.780 --> 00:06:06.360
Get the **** out of your ears and listen up!

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:11.090
A new war is breaking out 
in the wilds of Saga.

00:06:11.090 --> 00:06:12.970
This one's called the Saga Arena!

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:14.220
Saga Arena?

00:06:14.530 --> 00:06:17.440
And guess who's coming to 
break in the new venue.

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:18.830
Iron Frill!

00:06:19.240 --> 00:06:23.630
Inaugural performance, my ass! 
It's an arena in Saga!

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:26.440
Why the hell would you bring in 
a bunch of Tokyo idols for that?!

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:27.810
Anyway, boom!

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:31.780
<b>Saga Arena! Franchouchou's Counter-Inauguration Show</b>

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:32.430
I managed to cram you maggots 
in as Iron Frill's opening act!

00:06:32.430 --> 00:06:35.120
You're going to take the **** 
taste of Saga's inauguration

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:37.500
**** and make sure those 
little Tokyo **** girls

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:40.010
never forget it. Am I clear,
 maggot zombies?!

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:41.800
Are you for real?

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:43.160
Iron Frill...

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:49.350
Let's do it.

00:06:52.730 --> 00:06:54.390
We can do this.

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:56.190
I know we can.

00:06:57.400 --> 00:06:58.580
Ai-chan...!

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:03.950
Sorry to rain on your little parade here,

00:07:03.950 --> 00:07:05.660
but Ai is going to be absent for this one.

00:07:05.660 --> 00:07:07.290
Wait, why?!

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:11.870
You really think that's a good idea, 
Ai-chan? Going out in front of Iron Frill?

00:07:11.870 --> 00:07:15.620
With your face belonging to their 
legendary center and all?

00:07:16.190 --> 00:07:17.450
Screw you!

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:20.570
We've been been doing this all along without 
worrying about people recognizing us!

00:07:20.570 --> 00:07:23.510
And we already performed in the same 
show with Iron Frill at Saga Rock!

00:07:23.510 --> 00:07:26.220
That's right! We can't go on without 
Ai-san after all this time.

00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:29.020
Franchouchou is only Franchouchou 
if all of us are together, Kotaro-san!

00:07:29.020 --> 00:07:32.560
You maggot zombies need to 
quit yapping and get to work!

00:07:32.560 --> 00:07:35.170
I've got solo jobs lined up for you.

00:07:35.170 --> 00:07:37.220
You start on those tomorrow.

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:38.320
Dismissed!

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:42.710
Kotaro-san...

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:46.770
What the hell do we do now?

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:50.140
You know he doesn't listen
 when he gets like that.

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:53.970
There could always be a time when one 
of us will have to sit something out

00:07:53.970 --> 00:07:55.440
because of an accident...

00:07:55.790 --> 00:07:57.490
Depending how you think of it,

00:07:57.490 --> 00:08:00.590
this could be a chance for 
Franchouchou to grow up a bit.

00:08:00.590 --> 00:08:03.240
But I don't like the idea of only 
you being gone, Ai-chan!

00:08:03.490 --> 00:08:05.010
It's just this one time.

00:08:05.240 --> 00:08:08.390
Let's just make this part of our 
revenge for what happened at EFS.

00:08:09.650 --> 00:08:12.790
Junko... I'm counting on 
you to help the others.

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:15.590
You've got the most experience 
of everyone who will be left.

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:20.330
Right!

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:25.920
<b>{eyecatch signs are names of dishes}Zombie Land Saga Revenge</b>

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:30.920
<b>{eyecatch signs are names of dishes}Zombie Land Saga Revenge</b>

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:34.050
<b>Renewal Celebration!</b>

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:35.530
<b>The All-new Onion Fair</b>

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:35.310
Our guest today is Number Three
 from Franchouchou!

00:08:36.230 --> 00:08:39.740
Hi, there! I'm glad to be here!

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:42.410
<b>Saga Part-Time</b>

00:08:42.770 --> 00:08:45.580
You hear Number Three's 
gonna be doing solo stuff?

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:47.460
You think she's gonna 
put out solo music, too?

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:57.970
Kara Kara

00:08:47.980 --> 00:08:49.760
<i>Now, Number Three,</i>

00:08:49.760 --> 00:08:54.450
<i>have you ever been told you look a lot like 
Iron Frill's legendary center, Ai Mizuno?</i>

00:08:55.610 --> 00:08:57.960
<i>Yes, I hear that occasionally...</i>

00:08:58.360 --> 00:09:01.420
<i>It's honestly a huge honor</i>

00:09:01.420 --> 00:09:04.400
<i>to be compared to such a legendary idol!</i>

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:12.330
Number Three for a live event in Fukuoka...

00:09:12.560 --> 00:09:14.820
An appearance at the Nagasaki 
Hydrangea Festival...

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:17.210
and for the Beppu Hot Springs Hell...

00:09:19.070 --> 00:09:21.840
Nope, nope, and nope, sorry!

00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:22.950
Hey! Why not?!

00:09:23.210 --> 00:09:26.500
Franchouchou are Saga idols, 
created to save Saga.

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:29.300
Any offer from another 
prefecture is just a trap

00:09:29.300 --> 00:09:31.270
designed to capitalize on Saga's glory.

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:32.420
Don't be misled.

00:09:32.980 --> 00:09:35.190
This is the first time I'm 
hearing about this glory...

00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:38.870
What are you thinking?

00:09:40.370 --> 00:09:44.630
Why would you split us up
 at such an important juncture?

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:48.190
We can't afford to mess
 this next performance up.

00:09:48.990 --> 00:09:52.080
If it turns into a replay 
of what happened at EFS...

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:56.340
Franchouchou can do a perfectly fine 
job without you, thank you very much!

00:09:56.340 --> 00:09:59.250
Besides, isn't Junko 
handling the performance?

00:09:59.250 --> 00:10:01.070
Don't you trust her?

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:04.290
Junko managed to survive 
as a top idol by herself

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:05.930
when it was as hard as ever to do so!

00:10:05.930 --> 00:10:09.600
The others have gotten over the 
trauma of EFS and are working hard!

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:11.400
I'm sure they can...

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:13.880
Sounds to me like there's no problem, then!

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:16.820
You just need to focus on doing a 
greeeat job with your solo stuff

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:19.000
so the others can do a greeeat 
job with their show!

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:20.960
And pay back some of this freaking debt!

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:24.640
Then shouldn't we accept all those 
offers you just rejected, you idiot?!

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:28.280
You're on!

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:31.190
Thank you, coming!

00:10:31.620 --> 00:10:34.520
<i>Everyone's improving steadily...</i>

00:10:36.330 --> 00:10:38.160
<i>But the way things stand,</i>

00:10:38.160 --> 00:10:42.580
<i>I don't think we'll leave an impression 
on people who came to see Iron Frill.</i>

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:47.120
<i>There's not much time left...</i>

00:10:48.020 --> 00:10:50.870
<i>At this rate, it's going to happen again...</i>

00:10:51.800 --> 00:10:53.020
Junko-chan!

00:10:53.480 --> 00:10:54.650
Junko-chan?

00:10:55.460 --> 00:10:57.210
What did you think about that one?

00:10:57.210 --> 00:10:59.950
We probably still have a way to go, huh?

00:11:00.270 --> 00:11:04.310
Oh, no. There are things to address, 
but you're all definitely improving.

00:11:04.310 --> 00:11:05.610
For real?! Hell yeah!

00:11:05.610 --> 00:11:10.180
You had a scary look on your face the 
whole time, so I was kinda nervous.

00:11:10.180 --> 00:11:12.470
This is gonna be a big 
one for Franchouchou.

00:11:12.470 --> 00:11:15.680
We've gotta hit them with 
a really big impact!

00:11:16.340 --> 00:11:20.710
To do that, let's focus on 
getting one thing done at a time.

00:11:20.710 --> 00:11:24.570
Yeah. For me, that's moving too wildly
 and my mic coming loose...

00:11:24.570 --> 00:11:27.710
Saki-chan, you keep dancing out of habit
 in songs with choreography!

00:11:28.850 --> 00:11:30.490
Your mind is unsettled.

00:11:32.240 --> 00:11:34.450
I can't trust you with this right now.

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:40.050
Traditional 
Folk Arts
 Ozaki Doll 
Preservation
 Society

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:36.850
I'm sorry, sir.

00:11:37.290 --> 00:11:38.880
You can wrap up for today.

00:11:57.610 --> 00:11:58.850
I'm home...

00:12:01.640 --> 00:12:03.330
Hello there, Tae-san.

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:05.630
Is everyone else still at work?

00:12:05.630 --> 00:12:09.380
<i>Next up is Franchouchou's "Awaken Returner," 
the Number Three solo version!</i>

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:15.660
<i>Awaken returner! You just have to want it</i>

00:12:15.660 --> 00:12:19.330
<i>A miracle that you're longing to feel!</i>

00:12:20.520 --> 00:12:23.900
<i>Awaken returner! You just wish for it</i>

00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:29.970
<i>Excitement until you hit the limit 
and want more, more, more, and more!</i>

00:12:26.500 --> 00:12:29.490
If Ai-san had been alive during my day...

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:34.070
I'm sure she would've managed to 
become a top idol, even by herself.

00:12:36.510 --> 00:12:39.740
<i>When were my dreams filled 
with that yearning?</i>

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:39.320
I need to pull myself together!

00:12:39.730 --> 00:12:42.490
<b>Kyushu Saga International Airport</b>

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:55.420
Do you have any comments going into 
the Saga Arena show this weekend?

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:58.990
Yeah! We're going to do our best, 
so I hope everyone comes to see us!

00:12:58.990 --> 00:13:01.320
Your national tour seems 
to be going really well!

00:13:01.320 --> 00:13:03.600
It's no wonder they call you the 
absolute queens of idols!

00:13:03.600 --> 00:13:05.510
Everyone's expecting another big year...

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:09.310
Not really. I don't think there 
are any absolutes in this world.

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:13.880
I think it's our responsibility to keep 
moving forward and continue to evolve.

00:13:13.880 --> 00:13:14.770
Shiori...

00:13:15.030 --> 00:13:18.300
Saga's a significant place for Iron Frill.

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:22.660
I want to be sure to prove we're 
one of a kind and beyond compare

00:13:23.100 --> 00:13:27.490
to our legendary original center, 
who I'm sure is watching over us all.

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:32.740
She's put a lot of thought into this!

00:13:33.010 --> 00:13:36.400
Guess top idols from Tokyo 
are something else.

00:13:36.400 --> 00:13:40.220
They're gonna be performing at 
the Saga Arena show, too, right?

00:13:40.220 --> 00:13:42.330
As the opening act, yeah.

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:43.090
<b>Welcome to Franchouchou's homepage! 
You are the 45,720th visitor.</b>

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:43.090
<b>Latest Information 
 Performing at the inaugural show for Saga Arena! 
 Number Three will be appearing on Chika Chika Press! 
 Mini-Concerts At Various venues soon! 
Franchouchou's Drive-in Tori Commercial</b>

00:13:42.330 --> 00:13:45.530
Imagine if they showed Iron Frill up!

00:13:45.530 --> 00:13:47.880
There's no way it's gonna be that easy.

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:49.890
Checking in on Iron Frill as they get ready
 for the Saga Arena inaugural show!

00:13:49.880 --> 00:13:53.250
"We are one of a kind and beyond compare."

00:13:53.250 --> 00:13:56.780
So, is she declaring war on us 
in the opening act or what?!

00:13:56.780 --> 00:13:58.410
Bring it on, then!

00:13:58.410 --> 00:14:00.320
I think she might not even 
have us on her radar.

00:14:00.720 --> 00:14:03.440
They're much bigger names...

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:05.730
It'd only be natural.

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:05.740
Checking in on Iron Frill as they get ready
 for the Saga Arena inaugural show!

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:05.740
<b>Leader Shiori states "We are one of a kind and beyond compare."</b>

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:10.190
<i>If Iron Frill demonstrates they're 
on a completely different level...</i>

00:14:10.440 --> 00:14:16.330
<i>We're going to be labeled third-string 
idols... and we'll never get our revenge.</i>

00:14:20.690 --> 00:14:28.120
Impact...?

00:14:31.420 --> 00:14:32.440
Why?!

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:34.800
Huh? What the...?

00:14:45.810 --> 00:14:48.990
I'm sorry! Work went overtime...

00:15:18.050 --> 00:15:19.200
Thanks!

00:15:22.030 --> 00:15:23.070
What'd you think?!

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:25.660
Wh-What do you mean...?

00:15:25.660 --> 00:15:30.930
I figured we need something with more 
impact to leave a mark on Saga Arena.

00:15:30.930 --> 00:15:34.630
Look at this, Junko-chan!
 Tae-chan's really got a knack for it!

00:15:38.470 --> 00:15:42.510
B-But we should probably focus 
on singing and choreography first...

00:15:42.720 --> 00:15:44.880
We'll work hard on that, too!

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:47.980
But there's not a lot of 
time until the show...

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:51.980
So we thought, we have to do something 
to leave a big impression on the audience!

00:15:51.980 --> 00:15:54.340
It's bad enough Ai's missing.

00:15:54.340 --> 00:15:59.100
We gotta do whatever we can to dig in... 
or it's just gonna be another disaster.

00:15:59.630 --> 00:16:00.890
Junko-chan!

00:16:01.390 --> 00:16:03.860
Is this not gonna work...?

00:16:04.210 --> 00:16:06.460
I wouldn't say that, exactly...

00:16:06.460 --> 00:16:08.530
Then it'll work?! It'll leave an impact?!

00:16:10.510 --> 00:16:13.270
G-Give me some time to think it over, please.

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:15.350
Got it.

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:18.650
For now, let's try it one more time.

00:16:19.050 --> 00:16:20.260
Of course.

00:16:20.260 --> 00:16:22.700
I'm going to shake these maracas <i>sooo</i> much!

00:16:22.700 --> 00:16:23.670
Hell yeah!

00:16:43.650 --> 00:16:48.430
<i>As I saw the sun setting in the distance...</i>

00:16:50.710 --> 00:16:54.690
<i>Tomorrow comes to visit</i>

00:16:57.460 --> 00:17:02.290
<i>My ponytail's come half undone...</i>

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:08.250
<i>And my aching heart's dyed red like the sky</i>

00:17:40.630 --> 00:17:43.260
That was amazing, Junko-chan! That song—

00:17:46.150 --> 00:17:47.420
Sakura-san?!

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:03.590
They used that song a lot 
in commercials, y'know.

00:18:03.590 --> 00:18:05.020
I didn't know it was one of yours.

00:18:07.220 --> 00:18:10.520
It's the first song of mine that 
reached the top of the charts...

00:18:11.470 --> 00:18:16.490
It became a major landmark in people 
coming to know the name Junko Konno.

00:18:17.050 --> 00:18:20.070
I sing it often when I want to feel better.

00:18:21.090 --> 00:18:22.970
I'm sorry, Junko-chan...

00:18:24.270 --> 00:18:27.250
Maybe we were all just panicking.

00:18:27.630 --> 00:18:30.070
It's about more than a flashy impact.

00:18:30.260 --> 00:18:32.930
No, I feel the same way.

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:38.300
We're all so anxious, 
but I didn't notice...

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:42.250
I love being in Franchouchou.

00:18:42.710 --> 00:18:46.140
I want to make sure this 
concert is a success.

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:50.660
But... all I really know is how 
to demonstrate my personal appeal,

00:18:50.660 --> 00:18:53.180
as a solo Showa idol...

00:18:54.740 --> 00:19:00.440
I don't know how to make my experience 
pay off in a group environment.

00:19:01.940 --> 00:19:06.710
So far, I'm not doing a very good
 job as an idol senpai...

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:09.440
That's not true at all!

00:19:09.680 --> 00:19:12.830
The way you teach is really 
thorough and easy to understand,

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:15.230
and you pay a lot of attention to all of us!

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:18.050
You've taught us a whole 
bunch about being idols!

00:19:18.530 --> 00:19:19.630
Sakura-san...

00:19:21.630 --> 00:19:23.420
Let's ask Ai-chan about this!

00:19:23.940 --> 00:19:27.350
Even if she won't be on stage with us, 
we can still find out what she thinks.

00:19:27.740 --> 00:19:31.750
Kotaro-san didn't say we 
couldn't talk to her!

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:32.930
That's...

00:19:33.290 --> 00:19:37.680
Let's find out what she thinks 
about all of our ideas!

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:48.120
You're Franchouchou's Number Three, right?

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:52.590
You're from Iron Frill...

00:19:54.440 --> 00:19:56.090
You really do look just like her.

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:03.830
Huh? Ai-chan...?

00:20:03.830 --> 00:20:05.420
And isn't that—?!

00:20:07.500 --> 00:20:10.800
I've had my eye on Franchouchou 
for a while now.

00:20:11.250 --> 00:20:13.310
I know about what happened 
at the EFS show, too.

00:20:14.970 --> 00:20:18.050
You've been operating solo lately, right?

00:20:18.050 --> 00:20:19.850
I guess that means you finally caught on.

00:20:20.370 --> 00:20:21.650
What's that supposed to mean?

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:26.150
You have to realize Franchouchou 
is a bad fit for you.

00:20:29.560 --> 00:20:32.010
It comes through in your performances.

00:20:32.010 --> 00:20:35.090
You want to be in a group like Iron Frill...

00:20:35.510 --> 00:20:39.860
The ultimate top idols, 
the queens who reign at the top.

00:20:42.140 --> 00:20:45.330
Even if no one else could 
pick up on that, I could.

00:20:45.330 --> 00:20:47.750
Because I was chasing something similar...

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:51.060
Our legendary original center, Ai Mizuno.

00:20:51.590 --> 00:20:56.820
I've done everything I can to 
shine brighter than she did.

00:20:58.240 --> 00:20:59.350
I'm just—

00:20:59.830 --> 00:21:03.020
Number Three of Franchouchou! 
You should join Iron Frill!

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:08.960
You have a lot of potential,

00:21:08.960 --> 00:21:11.590
but if you stay in a 
backwards place like Saga,

00:21:11.590 --> 00:21:13.580
you'll never achieve the glory you're after!

00:21:13.810 --> 00:21:15.520
Iron Frill is unbeatable

00:21:15.520 --> 00:21:19.620
and we never spare the effort 
it takes to <i>stay</i> the strongest.

00:21:20.720 --> 00:21:24.820
We're the place someone
 like you really belongs.

00:21:27.940 --> 00:21:30.000
I don't expect an answer right now.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:32.660
I'll talk to you again this weekend,
 after the show.

00:21:34.160 --> 00:21:35.600
I'll show you

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:40.730
the kind of performance a group like 
Franchouchou could never accomplish.

00:23:24.880 --> 00:23:25.750
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:25.740 --> 00:23:26.840
This is Junko.

00:23:26.840 --> 00:23:31.060
If it would help someone shine brighter, 
would they be better off with a different team?

00:23:27.720 --> 00:23:28.470
<b></b>

00:23:31.630 --> 00:23:36.430
Next time on <i>Zombie Land Saga Revenge</i>
Episode 4: "Pure-Hearted Electric SAGA."

00:23:34.390 --> 00:23:39.910
<b>Episode 4: Pure-Hearted Electric SAGA</b>

00:23:36.430 --> 00:23:37.720
Don't miss it.
